graph TD
    A[Start] --> B[Staff submits internal form]
    B --> C[System pre-fills Program from Episode data]
    C --> D[Generate assessment link with embedded data]
    D --> E[Client clicks link and completes assessment]
    E --> F{Episode ID present?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Store Episode ID with assessment]
    F -->|No| H[Assessment stored without Episode ID]
    G --> I[End]
    H --> I
